{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36623","headline":"清溪江令公宅 · 罗隐","name":"清溪江令公宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蛮牋象管夜深时，曾赋陈宫第一诗。\n宴罢风流人不见，废来踪迹草应知。\n莺怜胜事啼空巷，蜨恋余香舞好枝。\n还有往年金甃井，牧童樵叟等闲窥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}